BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3d809cfd69f2@civicswa
DTSTAMP:20261111T161839Z
DTSTART:20261119T020000Z
DTEND:20261119T075900Z
SUMMARY:JOINT HEARING OF THE EAST WENATCHEE PLANNING COMMISSION AND DOUGLAS COUNTY PLANNING COMMISSION – CONTINUED FROM OCTOBER 28TH (Douglas County)
LOCATION:<p style='margin:0in\;font-size:16px\;font-family:"Aptos"\,sans-serif\;margin-bottom:12.0pt\;' data-pasted="true"><span style='font-size: 24px\; font-family: "Segoe UI"\, sans-serif\;'>City of East Wenatchee and Douglas County Joint Planning Commission meeting on November 18\, 2026\, is a continuation of the October 28\, 2026\, public hearing on Greater East Wenatchee Comprehensive Plan (including East Wenatchee Urban Growth Area)\, with corresponding amendments to zoning maps and development regulations.</span></p><p style='margin:0in\;font-size:16px\;font-family:"Aptos"\,sans-serif\;margin-bottom:12.0pt\;'><br></p><p data-pasted="true">AGENDA</p><p>Wednesday\, November 18\, 2026 - 6:00 PM</p><p>East Wenatchee City Hall\, Council Chambers</p><p>271 9th Street NE\, East Wenatchee\, WA</p><p>The hearing will be conducted in person with an Zoom option. To join using Zoom\, please use this</p><p>URL: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/81035562054 Or phone number 1-253-215-8782. Meeting ID:</p><p>810 3556 2054.</p><p>Public Testimony will be limited to three minutes. If there are many speakers\, a representative</p><p>may be appointed to speak on behalf of the group.</p><p>I. CALL TO ORDER</p><p>II. ADMINISTRATIVE PROCEDURES</p><p>A. None</p><p>III. CITIZEN COMMENT: The Citizen Comment period is to provide the opportunity for members of</p><p>the public to address the planning commission on a topic not on the agenda. The Chair will ask if</p><p>there are any citizens wishing to address the Commission. When recognized please step up to</p><p>the microphone\, give your name and mailing address\, and state the matter of interest. Citizen</p><p>comments will be limited to three minutes.</p><p>IV. OLD BUSINESS</p><p>A. None</p><p>V. NEW BUSINESS</p><p>A. Continued Public Hearing</p><p>Hearing procedures</p><p>A joint city/county public hearing continued from October 28th to consider amendments</p><p>to the Greater East Wenatchee Area Comprehensive Plan\, EWMC Title 17 Zoning\,</p><p>DCC Title 18A East Wenatchee UGA Zoning\, and EWMC Title 19.11 Definitions.</p><p>Comprehensive plan amendments include text amendments\, map amendments and</p><p>an expansion of the East Wenatchee Urban Growth Boundary. Development</p><p>regulation amendments include housing related changes and adoption of zoning maps</p><p>that correspond to the land use designation map in the comprehensive plan.</p><p>VI. OTHER BUSINESS</p><p>A. None</p><p>VII. ADJOURNMENT</p> - 271 NE 9th Street East Wenatchee WA 98802
URL:/common/modules/iCalendar/iCalendar.aspx?feed=calendar&catID=14
END:VEVENT
